[4348]="700411CC\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth\n",
[4349]="700400A5\n1\tSpeak to Beriaudur to learn more about the city guard\tBeriaudur has much to tell you about the city guard of Dol Amroth.\n2\tComplete Hashadîr - Captains of the Crew\030Complete Hashadîr - A Place to Lie at Night\030Complete Hashadîr - Slavers of Men\030Complete Hashadîr - Trapping the Beach\tTo prove yourself able to watch over the library, you must first accomplish a series of tasks. Tolrían will be able to inform you of the necessary tasks.\n3\tUse the Library Tokens to earn Acquaintance with the Library\tYou must be acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Library to be allowed to guard over it as part of the Dol Amroth town watch.\n4\tSpeak to Beriaudur\tBeriaudur is in Dol Amroth. Beriaudur will be pleased to hear you are now acquaintance with the Dol Amroth - Library.\n",
[4350]="700411C6\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth\n",
